  "Description": {
    "Cost": 1399780,
    "UIName": "Jaguar",
    "Id": "chassisdef_jaguar_JAG-P",
    "Name": "Jaguar",
    "Details": "For once Pirate Lingo makes sense on a Mech, the Bilge Rat is exactly like the archaic Rodent it gets its name from. Relying on a mixture of speed and EWAR does this Quad Mech try to skim under the Radar and hide in the murky depths of a Chaotic Battlefield. Showing some bite when threatened the Mech packs several MRM 5's with paired Chem Lasers wired through the cockpit. Whoever designed the couplings made the machine a bumpy ride at best with the fumes leading straight into the Cockpit. I can only compare this to huffing a Marker while trying to run for your Life, unless the Engine explodes underneath you in true PiraSte Fashion. Someone carved 'Cheese and Sin' in the cockpit's interior as well.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Protected Actuators</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.06</color></b>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_jaguar"
  },
